{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["拜偶像和真敬拜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列家啊，要听耶和华对你们所说的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华如此说：",{"text":"你们不要效法列国的行为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要为天象惊惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因列国为此事惊惶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众民的风俗是虚空的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在树林中用斧子砍伐一棵树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"匠人用手工造成偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们用金银妆饰它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用钉子和锤子钉稳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它不动摇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它好像棕树，是旋成的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能说话，不能行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必须有人抬着。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不要怕它；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它不能降祸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也无力降福。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，没有能比你的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你本为大，有大能大力的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国的王啊，谁不敬畏你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬畏你本是合宜的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为在列国的智慧人中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽有政权的尊荣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能比你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们尽都是畜类，是愚昧的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像的训诲算什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像不过是木头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有银子打成片，是从他施带来的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并有从乌法来的金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是匠人和银匠的手工，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有蓝色紫色料的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是巧匠的工作。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟耶和华是真 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是活 神，是永远的王。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一发怒，大地震动；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一恼恨，列国都担当不起。","poem":1},"（"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你们要对他们如此说：不是那创造天地的神，必从地上从天下被除灭！）"]},{"type":"heading","content":["颂赞 神的诗"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华用能力创造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用聪明铺张穹苍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一发声，空中便有多水激动；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使云雾从地极上腾；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他造电随雨而闪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从他府库中带出风来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人都成了畜类，毫无知识；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各银匠都因他雕刻的偶像羞愧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他所铸的偶像本是虚假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中并无气息，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是虚无的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是迷惑人的工作；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到追讨的时候必被除灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的分不像这些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他是造作万有的主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列也是他产业的支派，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华是他的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["预告被掳"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"受围困的人哪，当收拾你的财物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从国中带出去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这时候，我必将此地的居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像用机弦甩出去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又必加害在他们身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们觉悟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"民说：祸哉！我受损伤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的伤痕极其重大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我却说：这真是我的痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必须忍受。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的帐棚毁坏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的绳索折断。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的儿女离我出去，没有了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人再支搭我的帐棚，挂起我的幔子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为牧人都成为畜类，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有求问耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以不得顺利；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的羊群也都分散。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"有风声！看哪，敌人来了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有大扰乱从北方出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使犹大城邑变为荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为野狗的住处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，我晓得人的道路不由自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行路的人也不能定自己的脚步。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，求你从宽惩治我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在你的怒中惩治我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕使我归于无有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"愿你将忿怒倾在不认识你的列国中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和不求告你名的各族上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们吞了雅各，不但吞了，而且灭绝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他的住处变为荒场。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}